{"q":"49","t":"Group Anagrams","d":"Medium","p":false,"c":"<p>Given an array of strings <code>strs</code>, group the <span data-keyword=\"anagram\">anagrams</span> together. You can return the answer in <strong>any order</strong>.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p>\n\n<div class=\"example-block\">\n<p><strong>Input:</strong> <span class=\"example-io\">strs = [&quot;eat&quot;,&quot;tea&quot;,&quot;tan&quot;,&quot;ate&quot;,&quot;nat&quot;,&quot;bat&quot;]</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Output:</strong> <span class=\"example-io\">[[&quot;bat&quot;],[&quot;nat&quot;,&quot;tan&quot;],[&quot;ate&quot;,&quot;eat&quot;,&quot;tea&quot;]]</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Explanation:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>There is no string in strs that can be rearranged to form <code>&quot;bat&quot;</code>.</li>\n\t<li>The strings <code>&quot;nat&quot;</code> and <code>&quot;tan&quot;</code> are anagrams as they can be rearranged to form each other.</li>\n\t<li>The strings <code>&quot;ate&quot;</code>, <code>&quot;eat&quot;</code>, and <code>&quot;tea&quot;</code> are anagrams as they can be rearranged to form each other.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p>\n\n<div class=\"example-block\">\n<p><strong>Input:</strong> <span class=\"example-io\">strs = [&quot;&quot;]</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Output:</strong> <span class=\"example-io\">[[&quot;&quot;]]</span></p>\n</div>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 3:</strong></p>\n\n<div class=\"example-block\">\n<p><strong>Input:</strong> <span class=\"example-io\">strs = [&quot;a&quot;]</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Output:</strong> <span class=\"example-io\">[[&quot;a&quot;]]</span></p>\n</div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><code>1 &lt;= strs.length &lt;= 10<sup>4</sup></code></li>\n\t<li><code>0 &lt;= strs[i].length &lt;= 100</code></li>\n\t<li><code>strs[i]</code> consists of lowercase English letters.</li>\n</ul>\n","h":[],"m":"{\r\n  \"name\": \"groupAnagrams\",\r\n  \"params\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"strs\",\r\n      \"type\": \"string[]\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"return\": {\r\n    \"type\": \"list<list<string>>\",\r\n    \"dealloc\": true\r\n  }\r\n}","g":[{"name":"Array","slug":"array"},{"name":"Hash Table","slug":"hash-table"},{"name":"String","slug":"string"},{"name":"Sorting","slug":"sorting"}],"s":[{"t":"Valid Anagram","s":"valid-anagram","d":"Easy","p":false},{"t":"Group Shifted Strings","s":"group-shifted-strings","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Find Resultant Array After Removing Anagrams","s":"find-resultant-array-after-removing-anagrams","d":"Easy","p":false},{"t":"Count Anagrams","s":"count-anagrams","d":"Hard","p":false}],"co":[["Amazon","amazon"],["Google","google"],["Bloomberg","bloomberg"],["Meta","facebook"],["Apple","apple"],["tcs","tcs"],["Microsoft","microsoft"],["Infosys","infosys"],["Goldman Sachs","goldman-sachs"],["Adobe","adobe"],["JPMorgan Chase","jpmorgan"],["Expedia","expedia"],["Walmart Labs","walmart-labs"],["Oracle","oracle"],["Nvidia","nvidia"],["CrowdStrike","crowdstrike"],["HashedIn","hashedin"],["EPAM Systems","epam-systems"],["Palo Alto Networks","palo-alto-networks"],["Deloitte","deloitte"],["Smartsheet","smartsheet"],["Yandex","yandex"],["Visa","visa"],["BlackRock","blackrock"],["Instacart","instacart"],["Avito","avito"],["Okta","okta"],["Salesforce","salesforce"],["eBay","ebay"],["Docusign","docusign"],["IBM","ibm"],["TikTok","tiktok"],["Anduril","anduril"],["Zoho","zoho"],["Uber","uber"],["Affirm","affirm"],["PayPal","paypal"],["Nutanix","nutanix"],["SAP","sap"],["Cisco","cisco"],["Workday","workday"],["athenahealth","athenahealth"],["Disney","disney"],["BNY Mellon","bny-mellon"],["Squarepoint Capital","squarepoint-capital"],["Snap","snapchat"],["Twilio","twilio"],["Intuit","intuit"],["Citadel","citadel"],["Coupang","coupang"],["Dell","dell"],["Grab","grab"],["Jio","jio"],["Autodesk","autodesk"],["Sigmoid","sigmoid"],["Wayfair","wayfair"],["Compass"